{"id": "EUVD-2026-102978", "enisaUuid": "f35e1926-915c-3503-84ff-cdeb5958c3e4", "description": "WeRSS (we-mp-rss) through 1.5.3 contains a remote code execution vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to run code via the template parameter of the public GET /rss/{feed_id} endpoint. Attackers can supply a non-built-in ext value and a {{=expression}} template whose object-subclass traversal bypasses the eval denylist to run OS commands as the service account.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T19:05:43", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/werss-rss-template-unauth-ssti-rce", "https://github.com/rachelos/we-mp-rss/blob/v1.5.3/core/lax/template_parser.py#L1150-L1166", "https://github.com/rachelos/we-mp-rss/blob/v1.5.3/apis/rss.py#L185-L198", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/werss-we-mp-rss-through-1.5.3-rce-via-template-parameter-in-rss-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111687", "GHSA-hp95-p2ww-6rvc"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 1.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0cb7c2cd-896e-3305-ae44-a6a81a4fd4f5", "product": {"name": "we-mp-rss", "vendor": {"name": "rachelos"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.5.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4e4f1d1f-1c98-3903-9ecf-59e04f601a61", "vendor": {"name": "rachelos"}}], "isExploited": false}